# exam-terminal — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env.local for local development. All of these have defaults that are
# correct ON A REAL TERMINAL; they exist so the app can be run off-hardware.

# The Centre Edge this terminal proxies /api/* to. In production the terminal is
# served inside ZUUP-OS and /api/* is the Edge over the WireGuard tunnel (§6.4).
EDGE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4000

# The on-device biometric daemon (zuup-biometricd, §8.4). Loopback only, never
# the LAN. /biometric/* is proxied here so the kiosk CSP stays single-origin.
BIOMETRIC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:7700

# Where this machine's commissioned identity is read from. On a terminal this is
# inside the signed image and must NOT be overridden. There is deliberately no
# other way to set the terminal id — not a query parameter, not localStorage,
# not a form field: a machine that can be told which seat it is can be told to
# be the seat whose paper it wants.
# ZUUP_TERMINAL_ID_FILE=/etc/zuup/terminal-id
